<metadata><name>Brooks Meadow from Highway 35 (Road 44)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:215-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.373973" lon="-121.566853"><ele>1008.3</ele><name>Highway 35 at Road 44</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:hwy35-road-44 (OSM node 33436785); confidence: high; pdf_page: 214; book_elev_ft: 3280; quote: All tours in this area are reached by skiing (or driving) uphill on Road 44 from Highway 35 ... (3,280 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.408084" lon="-121.546922"><ele>1306.3</ele><name>Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring</name><desc>source: OSM node 33426868, as in or-vielbig-2e_218-1; OSM Clinger Spring node 45.408783,-121.550818 is 300 m west; confidence: high; pdf_page: 214; book_elev_ft: 4200; quote: Clinger Spring itself is 1,000 feet above and 3.6 miles from Highway 35.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.416224" lon="-121.525894"><ele>1302.4</ele><name>Road 44 / Road 17 junction (the book's 44/1720 junction), south end of Brooks Meadow</name><desc>source: OSM node 33437099, where NF 44 turns east (Dufur Valley Road) and NF 17 ('Brooks Meadow Road') goes north along the meadow's west side; 1.47 mi by Road 44 from the 4410 junction. Today's 17/1720 junction (node 33428671) is 0.45 mi further north at the meadow's north end: the book's text puts its junction at the south end, with Road 17 along the meadow's west side reaching it; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 217; book_elev_ft: 4280; quote: From Clinger Spring continue on Road 44 1.5 miles, or better yet ski the more interesting Surveyor Trail to the Road 44/1720 junction. Enter the trees straight ahead to locate nearby Brooks Meadow. ... go to the junction of Roads 44 and 1720 at the south end of Brooks Meadow.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Brooks Meadow from Highway 35 (Road 44)</name><desc>1. Highway 35 at Road 44 -&gt; Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring: osm (high), 3.78 mi | 2. Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring -&gt; Road 44 / Road 17 junction (the book's 44/1720 junction), south end of Brooks Meadow: osm (high), 1.45 mi</desc>
